                <mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 22px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;A.R.G.O.S SmartDesk enviorment&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;AI Interaction setup with pc, raspberryPi using file neural networking through a 500 line prompt. Project memory based, with command saving, automated file modification. Using context to make the AI determine which cheatsheet file to use.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" parent="1" vertex="1">
