                <mxCell id="22" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;Action Handling&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;The way the ai should be able to interact with the system is with a defined set of comands, this commands can be modified by the AI by interaction using this system recursively. If the ai is told to perform certian action, it will occur the following. Ai detects action, by default in the context if action&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;Ai should return do function, if code detects do function in ais response, sends prompt again to ai to select action from file with actions. once ai selects action, returns in resposne, function gets action, and performs. Case 2, ai doesnt find aqction in actions files, AI thinks ai creates action, returns actions file modified, if function detects a mopdification cause in context ai is needed to return type of respoonse, function substitutes file, ai looks again in actions, selects, returns in resposne, and poprogram performs&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="536" y="584" width="396" height="249" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="32" value="Types of actions&lt;div&gt;Perform&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;-browse&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;-open file(from shared folder)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;-execute file&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;-open link&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;-open program&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;(Each of this actions is related to a CMD command, the program will execute if its in ais reesponse. If ai decides actiojn the user is requestiong, does not exist, must return complete actions file with the new action added, and if program detects ais response type is modification, replaces the modificated file&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;align=left;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="829" y="264" width="175" height="281" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
